040-chu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p009","quote":"蓋太公之卒百有餘年，子丁公呂伋立。丁公卒，子乙公得立。乙公卒，子癸公慈母立。癸公卒，子哀公不辰立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p003","quote":"周文王之時，季連之苗裔曰鬻熊。鬻熊子事文王，蚤卒。其子曰熊麗。熊麗生熊狂，熊狂生熊繹。熊繹當周成王之時，舉文、武勤勞之後嗣，而封熊繹於楚蠻，封以子男之田，姓羋氏，居丹陽。楚子熊繹與魯公伯禽、衞康叔子牟、晉侯燮、齊太公子呂伋倶事成王。"}],"rationale":"楚篇明稱齊太公子呂伋，與齊篇太公子丁公呂伋的父子與名稱敘事暫同指。 未由同名泛推全庫、也未用此段校定共同任職年代。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p009","text":"蓋太公之卒百有餘年，子丁公呂伋立。丁公卒，子乙公得立。乙公卒，子癸公慈母立。癸公卒，子哀公不辰立。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m009-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"太公","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m009-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"丁公呂伋","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m009-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"丁公","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m009-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"乙公得","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m009-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"乙公","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m009-0032","start":32,"end":36,"surface":"癸公慈母","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m009-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"癸公","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m009-0043","start":43,"end":47,"surface":"哀公不辰","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p003","text":"周文王之時，季連之苗裔曰鬻熊。鬻熊子事文王，蚤卒。其子曰熊麗。熊麗生熊狂，熊狂生熊繹。